## Method
Read the target section first, then the interface contract and the record groups. For each operation, say what input it needs, what it may decide by itself, and what it must leave to Prime or the Director. You may propose a different split or a different first slice if you can show why.

## Cases
C01. A return arrives with a Hostile finding that contradicts a Director decision. Walk it through intake, review and find. Where could it be lost or silently promoted?
C02. Prime wants to reuse a prior experiment on the same subject page. Which operation must expose that, and from what record?
C03. A package is prepared for a ZIP-only recipient, and one required source is an image that was never committed. Which operation should stop it, and with what message?

